   Make it yours

   The settings in kit.yml that teams change first:

   1. packages: the packages the repository takes. Add and remove them with kit packages add and kit packages remove.
   2. policy: what a commit must pass.
   3. flow: the stages kit flow draws, in order.
   4. primary and forges: where issues and pull requests live.

   A house package holds the team's own rules. Read more in the docs
   (https://github.com/empowerite/kit/tree/main/docs).














